{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-15","kind":"proposition","title":"相等两三角形的一角等即等角旁之各两边互相视两三角形的一角等而等角旁之各两边…","englishTitle":"In equal triangles which have one angle equal to one angle the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional; and those triangles which have one angle equal to one angle, and in which the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional, are equal.","book":6,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.15/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","contentId":"euclid-6-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"38695c2f56e97a1751fd33923111738970a369cc4cbb66f948d54e2acbb64ecc","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-15.statement","euclid-6-15.construction.1","euclid-6-15.construction.2","euclid-6-15.construction.3","euclid-6-15.proof.1","euclid-6-15.proof.2","euclid-6-15.proof.3","euclid-6-15.proof.4","euclid-6-15.proof.5","euclid-6-15.proof.6","euclid-6-15.proof.7","euclid-6-15.proof.8","euclid-6-15.conclusion","euclid-6-15.historical.1","euclid-6-15.historical.2","euclid-6-15.historical.3","euclid-6-15.historical.4","euclid-6-15.historical.5","euclid-6-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67076136b03e873783876b29b7545862196682beb85617fdc7f05fb965c6a3a0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In equal triangles which have one angle equal to one angle the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional; and those triangles which have one angle equal to one angle, and in which the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional, are equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在具有一个角度等于一个角度的平等三角形中,对等角度的两边是成比例;对等角度的两边是成比例;对等角度的两边是成比例。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"相等两三角形之一角等即等角旁之各两边互相视两三角形之一角等而等角旁之各两边互相视即两三角形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个全等三角形的一个角意味着每条边都相等；一个角被认为相等，那么与相等角相邻的两条边也被认为相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85f1d1235185dbd61687265606f76be46df49d1d71ccf10c628f08ca7bda68d2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, ADE be equal triangles having one angle equal to one angle, namely the angle BAC to the angle DAE; I say that in the triangles ABC, ADE the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional, that is to say, that, as CA is to AD, so is EA to AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,ADE等量三角形,一个角度等于一个角度,即BAC至DAE角;我说,在ABC,ADE三角形中,对等角度的两边是成比例,也就是说,CA比AD等于EA比AB；CA 与 AD 之比等于 EA 与 AB 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b507a971c6cb32e1e42c62af7647fdc777f4ad2af2e13b559b02ae7d9496ee2","citations":["euclid-1-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let them be placed so that CA is in a straight line with AD; therefore EA is also in a straight line with AB. [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"把它们安置在一条直线上,使CA达到AD;因此,EA也与AB直线相连。 [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f43050944decaecf46dbc872c1d6136e1c660106563cf6e07937741728288bd0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let BD be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让BD连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"79018bc6ba1a0e12ba1308024b1a839267376766602006d20487684d20c24e4b","citations":["euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle ADE, and BAD is another area, therefore, as the triangle CAB is to the triangle BAD, so is the triangle EAD to the triangle BAD. [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,三角ABC等于三角ADE, BAD是另一个区域, 因此三角CAB与三角BAD的比等于三角EAD与三角BAD的比；CAB 与 BAD 之比等于 EAD 与 BAD 之比。 [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d765c2e4be18c36a36ad6d143f3a8bc5c2af61d9ba9f0a14b2a14a7300741c3d","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CAB is to BAD, so is CA to AD, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] and, as EAD is to BAD, so is EA to AB. [id.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CAB对BAD的比等于CA对AD的比,EAD对BAD的比等于EA对AB的比；CAB 与 BAD 之比等于 CA 与 AD 之比；EAD 与 BAD 之比等于 EA 与 AB 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bfc56f8a027d1b2d47ab540ea3b454edc380d1b59a1bdd2cc1f45a384c9b9db0","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as CA is to AD, so is EA to AB. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CA比AD的比例也等于EA比AB；CA 与 AD 之比等于 EA 与 AB 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d50ec0049b2001793c01b38ff2a55128e7b253f0565a6fa3b73e061bbf4657f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the triangles ABC, ADE the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在三角形ABC,ADE中,对等角度的两边是成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e7bedf1efce9b5028473e71d97b76e79747dfac21ea37cb7bc939e907b1ffcc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the sides of the triangles ABC, ADE be reciprocally proportional, that is to say, let EA be to AB as CA to AD; I say that the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle ADE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,三角形ABC,ADE的两边是对等的成比例,也就是说,EA是AB,CA到AD;我说三角形ABC等于三角形ADE；EA 与 AB 之比等于 CA 与 AD 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a99e88a8c79cb2465bd9b92f2ea1fc86518f40e9bb88e8e21be97873dd619276","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if BD be again joined, since, as CA is to AD, so is EA to AB, while, as CA is to AD, so is the triangle ABC to the triangle BAD, and, as EA is to AB, so is the triangle EAD to the triangle BAD, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore, as the triangle ABC is to the triangle BAD, so is the triangle EAD to the triangle BAD. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果BD再次连接,CA与AD之比等于EA与AB之比,而CA与AD之比等于ABC与BAD之比,EA与AB之比等于EAD与BAD之比,因此,三角ABC与BAD之比等于EAD与BAD之比；CA 与 AD 之比等于 EA 与 AB 之比；CA 与 AD 之比等于 ABC 与 BAD 之比；EA 与 AB 之比等于 EAD 与 BAD 之比；ABC 与 BAD 之比等于 EAD 与 BAD 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"079bf1e15e8fb0cbd4f342bb2298a4b9cad79ed13c5f92ef0393bedfd65bdc15","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the triangles ABC, EAD has the same ratio to BAD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ABC,EAD三角形的每个三角形比与BAD相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3cf2ee493954eb4cf588a976828db2fa8ceeb0894b5799195ff8be5dd2c5d347","citations":["euclid-5-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle EAD. [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此三角形ABC等于三角形EAD。 [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"38f8f782fd750206671d383a211bda5e2fbbfc2dcd7ff8e2b76ff6bd3c5c77a9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"相等两三角形之一角等即等角旁之各两边互相视两三角形之一角等而等角旁之各两边互相视即两三角形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个全等三角形的一个角意味着每条边都相等；一个角被认为相等，那么与相等角相邻的两条边也被认为相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c46bc6dcaa784f6b8ac32bf874cef3a4c737272d5d9accbd45ae63dfff65b321","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：甲乙丙乙丁戊两角形等两乙角又等题言等角旁之各两边互相视者谓甲乙与乙戊之比例若丁乙与乙丙也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，说明如下：甲乙丙乙丁戊，两个三角形的两个角相等，以及等价命题。说明：两边位于相等角旁边被认为相互认可。甲乙 与 乙戊 的比例类似于 丁乙 与 乙丙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12f5f92ee69e96a9ffc7a378018af6bbbac2d9d41637eba7b2d2067309917714","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试以两等角相聨于乙令甲乙乙戊为一直线其甲乙丙丁乙戊既等角即丁乙乙丙亦一直线〈一卷十五増题〉次作丙戊线相聨其甲乙丙乙丁戊两角形既等即甲乙丙与乙丙戊之比例若乙丁戊与乙丙戊也〈五卷七〉夫甲乙丙与乙丙戊两等高形之比例若其底甲乙与乙戊也而乙丁戊与乙丙戊两等高形亦若其底丁乙与乙丙也则甲乙与乙戊若丁乙与乙丙"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：尝试将两个相等的角连接到 乙，假设 甲乙乙戊 为直线。甲乙丙丁乙戊 是相等角，即 丁乙乙丙 也是直线。通过画线连接 〈一卷十五増题〉 到 丙戊，因此 甲乙丙乙丁戊 和 甲乙丙乙丁戊 三角形相等，即 甲乙丙 与 乙丙戊 的比例。如果 乙丁戊 与 乙丙戊 是 〈五卷七〉，甲乙丙 与 乙丙戊 是两个全等形状的比例：如果底边是 甲乙 与 乙戊，且 乙丁戊 与 乙丙戊 的高度相等，则 丁乙 与 乙丙 与底边相同。如果 丁乙 与 乙丙"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7464c1df7bd25583a044062599136cf976493b6e99ccecf88d3bc2303db276fc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"后解曰：两乙角等而乙旁各两边甲乙与乙戊之比例若丁乙与乙丙题言甲乙丙乙丁戊两角形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：两个 乙 角相等，每边 乙 上的 甲乙 与 乙戊 的比例相等，如果 丁乙 与 乙丙 是两个全等的三角形"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8a55ca9719b85e7db04c07cd0da51670457accbdffbbe80a787571370e1ddc64","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：依前列两形令等角旁两边各为一直线其甲乙与乙戊之比例既若丁乙与乙丙而甲乙与乙戊两底又若其上甲乙丙乙丙戊两等高角形丁乙与乙丙两底又若其上乙丁戊乙丙戊两等高角形则甲乙丙与乙丙戊之比例若乙丁戊与乙丙戊矣而甲乙丙与乙丁戊岂不相等〈五卷九〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：根据前两个形状，令等角旁边的每条边为直线。甲乙 与 乙戊 的比例给出 丁乙 与 乙丙，以及 甲乙 与 乙戊 作为底边的比例；如果 甲乙丙乙丙戊 是上方的两个轮廓三角形且 丁乙 与 乙丙 有两条底边，并且 乙丁戊乙丙戊 是一个等高三角形，则 甲乙丙 与 乙丙戊 的比例为 乙丁戊 与 乙丙戊，甲乙丙 与 乙丁戊 相等。〈五卷九〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-15.source","contentId":"euclid-6-15","revisionId":"euclid-6-15@raw-38695c2f56e97a17","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca447f20f1f05f74c17e49e4ea37c0595271caed87e89e656e0f487c9b7fb9f9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.15/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.15\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-15:euclid-1-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-15.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind"